# Eclipse VII — Event Horizon V4.1-F “Dark Corona Hedonic Edit” — 30 mL / 20% Theory Formula

**Status:** THEORY ONLY / NOT COMPOUNDED / NOT TESTED / NOT SAFETY-CLEARED  
**Format:** 6,000 uL concentrate brought to 30 mL finished perfume at 20% v/v, only if separately authorized after safety and stock gates  
**Lineage:** immutable V3 source -> immutable V4-F control -> this versioned V4.1-F successor  
**Design objective:** maximize the theory probability of pleasure, sensual floral-suede tactility, re-smell desire, and an enveloping unisex-to-feminine trail. DHP resemblance, structural complexity, numerical score, and ingredient count are not targets.

This successor does not mutate V3 or V4-F. It asks a simpler question: can a red-gold rose/osmanthus light, a soft black-suede center, and a warm skin trail produce more pleasure than V4-F's many individually legible effects? Every sensory, liking, luxury, depth, similarity, safety, stability, diffusion, longevity, and release result remains **NOT TESTED / HOLD**.

